SCHEDULE 1 – HAULIX

Product:          HAULIX – ETS2 Logger (desktop app for Windows, its installer and updates)
Price:            Free. No Paid Features are offered at the moment; Part C applies only if they are added later.
Allowed use:      Personal, non-commercial use as in section 1; use in VTCs and communities as in section 1.3.
Online Services:  Being prepared and not active yet (accounts, VTCs, company pages, events and convoys, job board,
                  leaderboards, cloud sync). When they start, Part B applies and signing in requires accepting the
                  current version of this agreement and the HAULIX Privacy Policy. Sharing is off by default.
Game:             HAULIX works with Euro Truck Simulator 2 by SCS Software and reads data the game provides on your
                  PC. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by SCS Software or TruckersMP.
Third-party rules: The optional TruckersMP anti-AFK message breaks the TruckersMP rules; it is off by default and
                  used at your own risk (section 5.3).
Privacy:          HAULIX Privacy Policy (PRIVACY).
Third-party code: THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.
